    <div class="itdgl-clinic-intro">
      <p>Reels + short-form viral content are the fastest way to build trichology clinic authority + patient pipeline in Nagpur, Maharashtra. Male + female pattern hair loss content, PRP + GFC procedure explainers, before-after growth documentation (with consent), and myth-busting drive massive reach + genuinely qualified patient leads. This FAQ answers 12 questions Nagpur trichology clinics ask about Reels + viral content.</p>
