    <div class="itdgl-evidence-band">
      <strong>ITD CLINIC MARKETING &mdash; WHAT WE ACTUALLY DO:</strong>
      ITD GrowthLabs runs full-stack digital marketing for haircare + trichology + hair loss clinics across Thane, Mumbai, Navi Mumbai, Dombivli, Kalyan, Nagpur, Nashik, and Pune. Social media management + Reels + viral content, Meta + Google ads, website + online booking + WhatsApp Cloud API integration, Google Business Profile optimisation + local SEO, and patient lead generation. We work with clinics that don't have in-house marketing teams — treating the marketing function as an outsourced growth partner, not a vendor. Every answer below reflects live clinic work.
    </div>

    <div class="itdgl-faq-list" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What Reels + viral content strategy works for a Nagpur trichology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Winning Reels: (1) Hair loss education (male + female pattern + androgenetic + telogen effluvium + alopecia — 200K-3M reach), (2) PRP + GFC + mesotherapy explainer (procedure demystification), (3) Myth-busting (hair oil myths + shampoo myths + hair transplant vs PRP), (4) Before-after growth compilation over 6-12 months (compliance-safe with disclaimer), (5) Trichologist personality + Q&amp;A + patient reactions, (6) Trichoscopy + microscopic-view content (visually striking), (7) Diet + lifestyle + stress + hair-loss connections. Reels reach 3K-2M per piece.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How many Reels per month should a Nagpur trichology clinic produce?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Boutique 5-8/month, Growth 10-20/month, Enterprise 20-45/month. Below 5, algorithm decays. Above 20 needs dedicated video team.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What is a realistic cost per Reel for a Nagpur trichology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">In-clinic filmed + agency-edited Rs 3,500-9,000. Full agency production Rs 10,000-25,000. Trichologist-led interview series Rs 20,000-50,000/session yielding 6-12 Reels. Bundled with retainer more cost-effective.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What compliance rules apply to trichology Reels?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Hair-regrowth claims must be substantiated. PRP/GFC/mesotherapy positioning non-miracle. Before-after growth with consent + disclaimer + same lighting/angle/time. No guaranteed outcomes. No comparative claims. In Nagpur, Maharashtra Medical Council + Maharashtra FDA + NMC (Nagpur Municipal Corporation) enforcement.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How do Reels drive patient inquiries for a Nagpur trichology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Reels → profile → DM/link-in-bio → WhatsApp/booking. 100K Reel reach → 400-1,500 profile visits → 25-100 DMs → 8-30 qualified leads → 3-12 booked consultations → 2-6 treated patients (long-cycle 60-180 day treatment). Reels-attributed revenue Rs 60,000-6 lakh per viral over 60-180 day attribution (longer than dermatology because trichology LTV is higher + long-cycle).</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">Which Reels platform matters most for Nagpur trichology?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Instagram Reels 50-55%, YouTube Shorts 20-30% (higher share than dermatology because hair-loss buyers research on YouTube extensively), TikTok 10-15%, Facebook Reels 5-10%.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How does trending audio + hashtag strategy work for trichology Reels?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Trending audio match to hair-loss topic. Hashtag stack: hyperlocal (#TrichologistThane), category (#HairLoss #HairTransplant), procedure (#PRP #GFC #Mesotherapy), trending. Marathi + Hindi hashtags amplify Nagpur reach.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How do we handle patient consent + before-after growth documentation?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Signed consent + 6-12 month growth documentation with same lighting/angle/time + disclaimer overlay + individual-variation caveat. Faces blurred if patient prefers. Consent revocable. In Nagpur, Maharashtra Medical Council + Maharashtra FDA + NMC (Nagpur Municipal Corporation) enforcement.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What common Reels mistakes damage Nagpur trichology clinics?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">(1) Guaranteed hair-regrowth claims. (2) Before-after without consent + disclaimer. (3) Poor quality. (4) Text-only. (5) No trending audio. (6) Weak hooks. (7) Repetitive templates. (8) No CTAs. (9) Miracle-cure PRP/GFC positioning. (10) Comparative claims. (11) Aggressive discount marketing. (12) English-only in Nagpur.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How does ITD produce Reels for Nagpur trichology clinics?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Monthly calendar (6-20/month), scripts + shot lists, filmed at clinic or agency-provided guides, edited with music + captions + compliance review + Marathi/Hindi captions per Marathi + Hindi + English. Weekly performance review. Bundled with full retainer (Rs 30,000-1.8 lakh).</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How do we start Reels with ITD for a Nagpur trichology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Free 30-min discovery. Audit + benchmark against top 5 Nagpur trichology clinics + 30-day Reels calendar + tier recommendation within 3 working days.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What is expected Reels growth trajectory for a Nagpur trichology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Month 1-3 baseline (2K-50K per piece). Month 3-6 first virals (100K-500K). Month 6-12 consistent viral cadence (500K+ per month). Month 12+ compounding. Follower growth 200-1,200/month, patient inquiries 25-120/month by month 12.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

